==Trivia==
*His Rising Mole Fist is a reference to the Shoryuken, a move from the [[wikia:streetfighter:Street Fighter series|Street Fighter]] franchise. [[Ken (Uber Rare Cat)|Ken]] (known as Sho-Ryu-Ken) means Rising Dragon Fist.
*His Japanese name, ''doryu'' (ドリュウ), is an uncommon reading of 土竜 ("mole") that happens to contain the name of [[Ryu (Uber Rare Cat)|Ryu]] (リュウ).
**The more common reading is ''mogura'', which is used as [[Corporal Weyland]]'s Japanese namesake, Captain Mogū.
**The Rising Mole Fist's Japanese name, Shodoryuken (昇土竜拳), is, of course, a portmanteau of ''doryu'' and ''Shoryuken'' (昇龍拳).

